{"id":1704,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>2026年3月24日下午4点，电气与控制工程学院举办基于AI 智能教学督导技术学习及应用教学沙龙，各系主任、副主任、教学指导委员会成员及青年教师代表参会。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eL7QykMmlaUm6knh7WVU874Lzl8LNl3bM4Lanl-bUlW7o7l0gihFp2hmCIa0L1hfoSy8M1yYMzvDL8UaLRlaLmnknzGsMRL8MRVVoz78Lz6FnR7sM4rkLRVFMznfnzLJqjfjo4OeoDX4q1hXptQ0g47aLRN0Lm-8LmlJqdBnx&oid=1127450808&tid=1009&nid=22425&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/2A94625763D005024BE0743441E91417/D1775B01/54AE3\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eMlry7LRQ2Lln2Uh4V2UlVkLmCbU4l3sLNCYoRlPn7U4U4G0gihFp2hmCIa0Lkh7MkysMkh2LzlZM7M7olLZL46fM8nfnzffMNQ7M4lDMzMFol7sUzvbnmrFMRvYn7WVgtXaQ4Oeo4x/vDw0qIbtpYyPLRGbg4-YMR-igtA8pUBcc&oid=1127450808&tid=1009&nid=22425&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eUl7yPoRMRLmLDLh4n7oRWVnRGDo7n3RM7rVUNr7o7nfU4-0gihFp2hmCIa0UYhVnkhVUYybUlVfUmNZMzT7LRWfM7W7UlQ7M8-boRfkMlQFLRQkn7WkLmrFMmLZUzvJqjfjo4OeoDX4q1hXptQ0g47aLRN0Lm-8LmlJqdBnx&oid=1127450808&tid=1009&nid=22425&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/CEDEC9AAAB9859D02A4BDAFD7B980B5F/06BDBB25/638A7\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eU4lybL8LDUz-aUhzNiMzLPoRUsoRL3Po7LbnNUYUmCYM4L0gihFp2hmCIa0MkhkM1hRM1yYMmU4M8QRLmLZozl8UznfL7-bnzW2Uz6VUzWFMlC4UlUPUzfFMR9aLmnfgtXaQ4Oeo4x/vDw0qIbtpYyPLRGbg4-YMR-igtA8pUBcc&oid=1127450808&tid=1009&nid=22425&e=.jpg\"></p><p>沙龙聚焦AI智能教学督导核心技术，详细介绍并演示在线巡课、视频点播行为分析、教学数据统计分析等功能模块。同时参会人员就本学期学院的教学督导工作及教学档案检查等重点工作进行研讨。此次活动旨在深入推进教育数字化转型，帮助教职工熟练掌握相关技术，提升教学督导效率与质量，为破解传统教学督导耗时费力、标准不一等问题奠定坚实基础。</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://ece.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=eL7QykMmlaUm6knh7WVU874Lzl8LNl3bM4Lanl-bUlW7o7l0gihFp2hmCIa0L1hfoSy8M1yYMzvDL8UaLRlaLmnknzGsMRL8MRVVoz78Lz6FnR7sM4rkLRVFMznfnzLJqjfjo4OeoDX4q1hXptQ0g47aLRN0Lm-8LmlJqdBnx&oid=1127450808&tid=1009&nid=22425&e=.jpg"}